  "coverageNotes": "EXCERPT of movement I: all 11 Clarinet in A systems on PDF pages 1-3, bars 1-62. System starts are 1/8/15, 22/28/33/37, 42/48/53/58, verified against source piano-system bar numbers and target barlines. PDF page 4 begins bar 63 and is outside scope. All written rests are retained, including six whole-bar rests at bars 42-47; no tacet duration or multimeasure rest is invented. Source page divisions are retained for reference. Detection found all 44 source staves (12/16/16), but crop edges needed manual corrections; 11 reviewed target envelopes protect recorded notation. Neighboring fragments are accepted context. No exclusions or scan deskewing are applied.",
  "sharedMarkings": "Opening Allegro and original Klarinette in A label are retained. Every target dynamic, hairpin, slur, tie, articulation, key/time signature, accidental, ledger note and written rest within scope is kept. Bar labels are editorial copies of verified source system starts. There are no rehearsal letters or tempo changes in these 3 pages. End at bar 62 is an explicit excerpt boundary with a phrase continuing into excluded page 4."
